To align the paragraph to the bottom of the header div, you can use Flexbox or absolute positioning. Here's an example using Flexbox:

```css
#header {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: row;
    justify-content: space-between;
    align-items: flex-end;
    height: 200px;
}

#logo {
    float: none;
}

#quote {
    margin-left: auto;
}
```

This will align the paragraph to the bottom of the header div.

